# Registered RED controls (scripts/test-governance/case-control-oracles.json:
# expected_status FAIL — a mismatch, never an Error): the strict face compares
# the REAL cause, so a wrong family, a wrong stage, and the pre-911 generic
# `mn.unsupported.frontend` shell must all stay red against src/B17.at.

```test-case
